    "detailed_description": "Rise High is an arcade action game in which you have to defend your workers from an alien invasion while they try to build skyscrapers!<br><br>Collect power-ups and battle different kinds of aliens, rescue your workers from abductions and try to survive all 30 levels of old-school arcade action.<br><br>Features single and two player coop mode - and as a fun little addtion a two player dogfight mode where you can try to shot you friend from the skies!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30 levels<br></li><li>3 difficulties<br></li><li>Online leaderboards<br></li><li>Bosses<br></li><li>Infected buildings<br></li><li>Controller and keyboard controls<br></li><li>One and two player gameplay<br></li><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Steam trading cards</li></ul>",
